    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commūnĭcātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id. (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>He who makes one a participant in a thing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rei familiaris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 4, p. 154 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>He who has part in a thing</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Tert. Pudic. 22</span></i>.</div>
